  - id: lantern
    speaker: "Rowan · Gardener"
    line: Ah, the <link="moss-lantern"><u>moss lantern</u></link>. It hummed the
      night of the storm. The shard by the reeds remembers more than I do.
    discoverTopicId: 
    choices:
    - label: I'll take a look.
      nextId: start
      requiredTopicId: 
      requiredTrust: 0
      lockedReason: 
      isLeave: 0
      isKey: 0
    - label: See you later.
      nextId: 
